      <chord name="F"/>Sing them over a<chord name="C7"/>gain to me, wonderful words of <chord name="F"/>life,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Let me more of their <chord name="C7"/>beauty see, wonderful words of <chord name="F"/>life;<br/>
