      <chord name="C7"/>wonderful <chord name="F"/>words <chord name="C7"/>of <chord name="F"/>life;<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>All <chord name="F"/>so <chord name="C7"/>freely <chord name="F"/>given,<br/>
